# Python bytecode — list_conversations.py / list_briefs.py generate these on every
# run; without this they get swept into PRs by `git add -A`.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# skill-improver local floor cursors normally live under ~/.claude/skill-improver/
# (checkout-independent, see scripts/list_conversations.py). This entry is a safety
# net in case a run is pointed at an in-repo state path with --state.
skills/skill-improver/state/*.local.json
